<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37572" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοπλ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>arm completely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.100
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.5.22
			</span></i>, al.; poet., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Ἄρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					683
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				702
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				99
			</span></i> (all lyr.):—
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			, <i>arm oneself,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολήν . . λέοντος, ᾗπερ . .
				ἐξωπλίζετο,</span> of Hercules, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				466
			</span></i>; <i>get under arms, stand in armed array,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IT</u>
				302
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄπισθεν τῶν ἁρμαμαξῶν ἐξοπλίσθητε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξωπλισμένος</span>”
				<i>fully armed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					454
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				555d
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξωπλισμένος</span>”
				<i>fully prepared, ready,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					566
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζα . . πρὸς εὐτέλειαν ἐξωπλισμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					226.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				217.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>disarm,</i>
			
			<i>deprive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καίσαρα τῆς στρατιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					2.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				29.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				40.5
			</span></i>.</div>
